{"id":"c01","stage":0,"title":"第一次见面","scene":"在语言学校，和新同学打个招呼。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c01-1","ko":"안녕하세요.","zh":"你好。","note":"日常见面的礼貌问候；见陌生人或老师也可以这样说。","words":[{"term":"안녕하세요","zh":"你好","id":"2c68318e35297111","audio":"/audio/2c68318e352971113645.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/8b118d6741f7cfa1a7ee.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"안녕하세요.","meaning":"你好","explanation":"안녕하다（安好）+ -세요（尊敬、礼貌的语尾）；整体是惯用问候。","readings":[{"term":"안녕하세요","audio":"/audio/2c68318e352971113645.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c01-2","ko":"저는 민지예요.","zh":"我叫敏智。","note":"저는：我；名字后用 예요 / 이에요 表示“是”。","words":[{"term":"저","zh":"我（谦称）","id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/335dbb8d1f9840a5ca8e.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저（我，谦称）+ 는（提示话题）。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}]},{"text":"민지예요.","meaning":"叫敏智","explanation":"민지（人名敏智）+ 예요（이다“是”的礼貌形式，用在无收音名词后）。","readings":[{"term":"민지예요","audio":"/audio/9173d430aeee31e7e9a4.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c01-3","ko":"이름이 뭐예요?","zh":"你叫什么名字？","note":"直译是“名字是什么”；中文省去不自然的逐字对应。","words":[{"term":"이름","zh":"名字","id":"253d1510caf53620","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"},{"term":"뭐","zh":"什么","id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/588d25be7d113ed1f1cf.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"이름이","meaning":"名字","explanation":"이름（名字）+ 이（主格助词，有收音后使用）。","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}]},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"是什么？","explanation":"뭐（什么，무엇的口语形式）+ 예요（是，礼貌体）；问号表示提问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c01-4","ko":"저는 리밍이에요.","zh":"我叫李明。","note":"리밍 有收音 ㅇ，所以接 이에요。","words":[{"term":"이다","zh":"是","id":"5f27e86550f797b5","audio":"/audio/5f27e86550f797b50252.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/0e7e1213d845acbd5d2a.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저（我，谦称）+ 는（提示话题）。","readings":[{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}]},{"text":"리밍이에요.","meaning":"叫李明","explanation":"리밍（人名李明）+ 이에요（이다“是”的礼貌形式，用在有收音名词后）。","readings":[{"term":"이다","audio":"/audio/5f27e86550f797b50252.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c01-5","ko":"만나서 반가워요.","zh":"很高兴认识你。","note":"만나다（见面）变为 만나서，后面接感受。","words":[{"term":"만나다","zh":"见面","id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"},{"term":"반갑다","zh":"高兴见到","id":"d5cacddd111bc906","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/a5fddbc201cb8774cdb7.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"만나서","meaning":"见到你，所以","explanation":"만나다（见面）+ -아서/어서（连接原因）；相遇是后面“高兴”的原因。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}]},{"text":"반가워요.","meaning":"很高兴","explanation":"반갑다（见到某人很高兴）→ 반가워요；ㅂ不规则变化，-아요/어요为礼貌体。","readings":[{"term":"반갑다","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c01-6","ko":"저도 반가워요.","zh":"我也很高兴认识你。","note":"도 表示“也”。","words":[{"term":"도","zh":"也","id":"a3ec07cdd87ae1fa","audio":"/audio/a3ec07cdd87ae1fabd09.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/9a6ab84994d8deea8e8d.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"저도","meaning":"我也","explanation":"저（我，谦称）+ 도（也）。","readings":[{"term":"도","audio":"/audio/a3ec07cdd87ae1fabd09.mp3"}]},{"text":"반가워요.","meaning":"很高兴认识你","explanation":"반갑다的礼貌形式；主语是“我”，对象依语境省略。","readings":[{"term":"반가워요","audio":"/audio/06d7434a5981e4364502.mp3"}]}]}],"day":1,"sequenceScore":0.56,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["你叫什么名字？","你从哪里来？","你在哪里上学？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["很抱歉让你久等了。","很高兴认识你。","谢谢你帮了我。"],"answer":1}]}
